Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:14:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2134/3799] soh: rename func_809670AC -> Demo6K_FadeWhiteout

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: shrinks the whiteout away over 120 frames and kills the actor
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_6K/z_demo_6k.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_6K/z_demo_6k.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_6K/z_demo_6k.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_6K/z_demo_6k.c
index bb6fec440..ddeb9cee5 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_6K/z_demo_6k.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_6K/z_demo_6k.c
@@ -272,7 +272,8 @@ void Demo6K_ExpandWhiteout(Demo6K* this, PlayState* play) {
     this->timer1++;
 }
 
-void func_809670AC(Demo6K* this, PlayState* play) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_809670AC: shrinks the whiteout away over 120 frames and kills the actor
+void Demo6K_FadeWhiteout(Demo6K* this, PlayState* play) {
     this->timer2++;
 
     if (this->timer1 < 10) {
@@ -299,7 +300,7 @@ void func_8096712C(Demo6K* this, PlayState* play) {
 
     if ((play->csCtx.state != CS_STATE_IDLE) && (play->csCtx.npcActions[6] != NULL) &&
         (play->csCtx.npcActions[6]->action == 2)) {
-        Demo6K_SetupAction(this, func_809670AC);
+        Demo6K_SetupAction(this, Demo6K_FadeWhiteout);  // was func_809670AC [LLM:HIGH]
         this->timer1 = 0;
         this->actor.scale.x = 0.1f;
     }
